    </div>

    {/* Legacy statement */}
    <div class="text-center mt-10 md:mt-24" id="founders-legacy">
      <div class="inline-block relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-x-8 -inset-y-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-amber-50 to-transparent rounded-lg"></div>
        <p class="relative text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 font-satoshi leading-relaxed max-w-2xl px-2">
          Their dedication, integrity, and commitment to excellence continue to guide every stone we crush and every project we support.
        </p>
      </div>
